-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/RVBR> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Magmatic-breccia with subsidiary tuffisite. Bedrock. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Mid Devonian Epoch - to - Late Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (394.3-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
